      "statement": "Two separate local Postgres compose stacks exist on different ports so they can run simultaneously: compose.postgres.yml is a persistent dev instance (postgres:16, port 5432, database trusted_actions, named volume rosa_ta_pgdata, managed by make postgres-up/postgres-down/postgres-logs) and docker-compose.test.yml is an ephemeral store-test instance (port 5433, database trusted_actions_test, no persistent volume, managed by make test-postgres-up/test-postgres-down/test-postgres under a distinct compose project name).",
