    {
      "id": "claim_875218d9ce0549829b6f4f291b14cb08",
      "statement": ".pre-commit-config.yaml defines local quality-gate hooks mirroring CI's ci/prow/lint: file hygiene and YAML checks (pre-commit-hooks v5.0.0), secret scanning via gitleaks v8.18.0 configured by .gitleaks.toml (with allowlisted paths like test fixtures, *_test.go, vendor/, node_modules/, internal/openapi/, and known-safe placeholder patterns), golangci-lint v2.0.2 run with --config=./.golangci.yml to match CI exactly, and local hooks go-build, go-mod-tidy, and rbac-wildcard-check; security hooks such as gitleaks are never bypassable even via SKIP=hook-id.",
