      "id": "claim_cf2d36ceaacb4396a7b50827596b9207",
      "statement": "Setting ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled swaps in auth.NewMockAuthMiddleware()/auth.NewMockAuthzMiddleware(), injecting a hardcoded dev-user identity with the SREP role for every request with no OCM/AMS network calls, and cmd/server/main.go logs a WARN on startup to make the bypass visible; this policy must never be used outside local or CI environments.",
