    {
      "id": "claim_64c85235e7b04d188996599341a8fea4",
      "statement": "When ROSA_TA_AUTH=disabled, cmd/server/main.go enforces two fatal startup guards: ROSA_TA_KUBECONFIG must be set (otherwise mock-authenticated callers could reach the real Backplane-provisioned cluster infrastructure unauthenticated) and ROSA_TA_AWS_ENDPOINT_URL must be set (otherwise the AWS SDK's default credential chain could expose real ambient AWS credentials to an unauthenticated caller); together with ROSA_TA_KUBECONFIG, this produces a fully local path with zero OCM/Backplane/real-AWS dependency.",
